5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need a system that actually works. Lately, the car isn't always where it should be or in a usable state.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I agree! It's becoming a total headache. I'm tired of spending my whole evening just figuring out who owes what.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us look at the facts calmly. To find true harmony, we must first understand the actual costs we share.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It's not just about the money. We're all getting snappy with each other. I want to know why this is actually ruining our mood.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you guys! But we're just guessing on the money, right? I want to see the real numbers before we decide anything!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, numbers are fine, but they don't tell us why the car is dirty or missing on a Tuesday morning.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. The ""admin"" part of this is a nightmare. I want to see where all our time is actually going.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A fair share is a beautiful thing, but we must ensure no one is quietly carrying the burden for others.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we just make a strict rule, we might still hate each other. We need to see how other people handle this without fighting.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we don't know who is driving the most, how can we be fair? We need a real picture of the usage!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm more concerned with the daily reliability. I'll look into the actual usage patterns and the car's condition.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'm going to focus on the time sink. I want to see the diary and how often we're repeating the same trips.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall examine the financial foundations. The taxes and the fuel receipts will reveal the hidden subsidies we've ignored.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking into what other households do. I also want to see if we're just arguing over the same things every week.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going for the fuel receipts too! And I want to see the hours recorded in the diary to match the costs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Let's just make sure we don't ignore the physical state of the vehicle in our search for ""fairness.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"As long as the new system doesn't require more spreadsheets, I'm happy. Let's get the data.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Truth is the first step toward peace. I look forward to seeing what the numbers tell us about our generosity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Just don't let the numbers make us forget we're friends. Let's find a way to stop the snapping.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll be the one to keep us positive! Let's find the truth and then make a plan that's awesome for everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
