35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The diary shows a huge gap between weekends and weekdays. Also, the car is often handed over dirty or nearly empty.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,It's worse than that. Those weekly repeating trips are where all the fighting happens. We spend hours arguing over the same slots!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The numbers are revealing. Some of you have been very generous, while others have lived comfortably on your kindness. This is the subsidy I feared.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,I found out that other groups fail when they have to ask for favors too often. We're doing exactly that with our weekly trips.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I saw the fuel receipts! It's crazy—some of us are paying way more than others. We've been totally guessing this whole time!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, fuel is one thing, but the frustration of a dirty car on a weekday morning is what really breaks the routine.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,Exactly! And the mental load of coordinating those repeating trips is exhausting. We're wasting our evenings on logistics.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"When we ignore the mathematical reality, we create an emotional debt. The imbalance in fuel is a symptom of a lack of structure.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we just focus on the money, we'll still be fighting over the ""favors"" and the repeating trips. We need a system that removes the need to ask.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Servas! We can't just ignore that some people are paying for everyone else. That's not fair to our friends!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"A strict schedule might help, but only if it includes a rule about the car's condition. I can't deal with rubbish in the car.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"I just want the ""untangling"" to stop. Whether it's money or time, I'm done with the endless back-and-forth every single night.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must move from ""improvised kindness"" to ""structured equity."" Only then can we truly enjoy each other's company without resentment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm worried a strict schedule will make us feel like strangers. But if it stops the ""favor"" cycle, it might actually save us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I want a system where we know exactly what we owe. No more envelopes, no more guessing. Just clear, honest figures!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"As long as the system ensures the car is ready for the next person, I'm open to whatever. Reliability is my priority.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,I'm voting for whatever requires the least amount of talking and calculating. My free time is too precious for this.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that fairness is not just about the coin, but about the peace of mind that comes from knowing all is right.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'll support a plan that stops the friction. If we can automate the boring stuff, we can go back to being friends.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! Let's look at the options and pick the one that's the most honest about the costs and the driving!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
